[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1383.23, "timestamp": "00:23:03", "text": "好的，我明白了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1387.029, "timestamp": "00:23:07", "text": "耶。我需要一把……嗯，就是这种剪刀。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1390.47, "timestamp": "00:23:10", "text": "太酷了。你可以把它拆开。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1394.789, "timestamp": "00:23:14", "text": "它变成了一把剪刀。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1398.83, "timestamp": "00:23:18", "text": "好的。是的，这就像一个可折叠的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1402.31, "timestamp": "00:23:22", "text": "先生，请看。太可爱了。这就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1405.51, "timestamp": "00:23:25", "text": "虽然是儿童剪刀。是的。狗是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1407.43, "timestamp": "00:23:27", "text": "孩子。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1410.47, "timestamp": "00:23:30", "text": "不，我想要的是便于携带的东西。喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1420.42, "timestamp": "00:23:40", "text": "是的。那么，我该如何切割呢？只是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1425.549, "timestamp": "00:23:45", "text": "[音乐]"}]